function renderEquippedSummary(){const root=$('equippedSummary');if(!root)return;root.replaceChildren();const look=lookFor(dressChar), labels={set:'Set',cloth:'Ropa',hair:'Cabello',eyes:'Ojos',accessory:'Accesorio'};const currentName=(slotKey)=>{if(slotKey==='set'){let setItem=catalog.find(i=>i.slot==='set'&&(!i.character||i.character===dressChar)&&(own(i.id)||(!i.exclusive&&i.parts.every(own)))&&equipped(i,dressChar));return setItem?.name||(['cloth','hair','eyes','accessory'].every(k=>look[k]==='original')?'Sin set':'Personalizado')}const value=look[slotKey];if(value==='original')return 'Original';let item=catalog.find(i=>i.slot===slotKey&&i.value===value);return item?.name||value};for(const key of ['set','cloth','hair','eyes','accessory']){let row=document.createElement('div');row.className='equipped-row';row.innerHTML=`<span>${labels[key]}</span><strong>${currentName(key)}</strong>`;root.append(row)}}
